/v1/","context":{"app_id":4778320,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"review_scope":"store_summary_filtered","percentage_precision":"source_rounded_integer","review_score_label":"사용자 평가 없음"},"error_code":"no_reviews"},{"game_id":"steam-4778320","metric":"demo_ccu","observed_at":"2026-10-26T09:48:14Z","value":1,"status":"ok","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/ISteamUserStats/GetNumberOfCurrentPlayers/v1/?appid=4855680","error_code":null}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-4778320-1847286114031541","game_id":"steam-4778320","kind":"announcement","title":"AITuber Nyano plays AiyaDesire!","summary":"AITuber Nyano plays AiyaDesire!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-22T07:18:41Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114031541","verified_at":"2026-10-22T10:59:28Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4778320-1847286114027344","game_id":"steam-4778320","kind":"announcement","title":"Aiya Desire is in Steam Next Fest! Play the free demo","summary":"Aiya Desire is taking part in Steam Next Fest: October 2026!Enter the massive radio tower Sentinel and uncover its mysteries. Explore rooms, solve puzzles, and escape a relentless pursuer. When a boss battle begins, the game shifts into a two-button rhythm battle.Try it for free using the “Download Aiya Desire Demo” button on this store page. Whether this is your first visit or you have played before, we hope you enjoy exploring.Steam Next Fest dates: October 19, 2026 at 10 AM PDT through Octobe","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-21T02:42:53Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114027344","verified_at":"2026-10-21T08:06:40Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4778320-1846018067930905","game_id":"steam-4778320","kind":"update","title":"Major Demo Update: Visual Upgrades, Map Updates & New Features","summary":"A major update for the Aiya Desire demo is here!We've upgraded the visuals and updated the maps. We've also added two features planned for the full game, giving you a chance to try them early in the demo.There's more to this update than a new look. Step inside and discover what's changed.■ Upgraded VisualsWe've improved the game's visual quality. As you explore, take a moment to pause and take in the refreshed world of Aiya Desire.■ Map UpdatesWe've updated the demo's maps. Already played? Retur","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-08T17:47:49Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067930905","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:03:50Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4778320-1836506165572037","game_id":"steam-4778320","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update: New Track Added, 24 Charts Now Playable","summary":"Dear players,We have released an update for the demo version of Aiya Desire.In this update, we have added one new track to Rhythm Game Mode.With EASY, NORMAL, and HARD difficulties included, a total of 24 charts are now playable.If you would like to enjoy the game more casually, you can play on EASY.If you prefer a standard level of challenge, try NORMAL.And if you want a more intense rhythm game experience, HARD is also available.The main changes are as follows:・Added one new track to Rhythm Ga","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-04T07:34:49Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165572037","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:03:50Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4778320-1836506165559647","game_id":"steam-4778320","kind":"announcement","title":"Soccer Fever Mini Event: The Pursuer Is Now a Ball","summary":"Dear players,We have added a limited-time mini event to the demo version of Aiya Desire, inspired by the excitement of soccer season.During the event, the enemy that chases the player will appear as a soccer ball.A soccer ball is usually something you kick.This time, it is chasing you.There are no major changes to the basic rules or progression of the game.This event simply adds a small, seasonal twist to the usual exploration and tension of Aiya Desire.The main event details are as follows:・The","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-29T09:03:35Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165559647","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:03:50Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4778320-1836506165559145","game_id":"steam-4778320","kind":"update","title":"Update: New Track and Easy Mode Added to Rhythm Game Mode","summary":"Dear players,We have released an update for the demo version of Aiya Desire.In this update, we have added a new track and Easy Mode to Rhythm Game Mode.This should make the rhythm gameplay easier to enjoy, especially for players trying it for the first time or those who found the standard difficulty a little challenging.We have also made several adjustments to improve the overall feel and presentation of the game, including sound effects, UI visuals, asset images, and Aiya’s walking animation.Th","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-29T02:52:05Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165559145","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:03:50Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4778320-1836506165552989","game_id":"steam-4778320","kind":"update","title":"Mini Update: Rhythm Game Mode Adjustments","summary":"Dear players,We have released a mini update for the demo version of Aiya Desire.This update focuses on making Rhythm Game Mode easier to play, with adjustments to boss track availability, the settings screen, and visual effects options.The main changes are as follows:・The boss track can now be played from the start without clearing the tutorial・The selected item on the settings screen is now easier to see・An option to turn off effects in Rhythm Game Mode has been added・Adjustments have been made","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-26T07:54:23Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165552989","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:03:50Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4778320-1836506165548055","game_id":"steam-4778320","kind":"update","title":"Update: Rhythm Game Mode Added","summary":"Dear players,A new Rhythm Game Mode has been added to the demo version of Aiya Desire.In addition to the story experience available so far, you can now also enjoy the game purely as a rhythm game.With this newly added Rhythm Game Mode, the rhythm gameplay can be played more casually and repeatedly.Whether you would like to experience the atmosphere of the main game or simply enjoy Aiya Desire as a rhythm game, we hope you will give this new mode a try.If you encounter any issues while playing, o","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-25T06:41:36Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165548055","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:03:50Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4778320-1836506165544631","game_id":"steam-4778320","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo Now Available: The First Signal from Sentinel","summary":"Dear players,The demo for Aiya Desire is now available on Steam.A mother’s death.A missing father.A strange black chip left on the desk.And the colossal signal tower where every transmission converges — Sentinel.In this demo, you can experience the beginning of Aiya’s journey into the truth, featuring the core elements of Aiya Desire: exploration, puzzle-solving, psychological horror, and two-button rhythm battles.Inside Sentinel, strange rooms, hidden logs, surveillance devices, and mechanisms ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-24T01:47:56Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165544631","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:03:50Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4778320-1835871199312020","game_id":"steam-4778320","kind":"announcement","title":"Crowdfunding Is Still Open: Leave Your Record in AIYA’s World","summary":"There is still time to leave your mark on the world of AIYA.Crowdfunding for Aiya Desire is still open as we continue working toward the game’s completion. This is a reminder for anyone who may have missed the previous announcement, or who planned to check the details later.Your support will be used to complete the main game, improve the quality of the visuals, audio, and presentation, and prepare for post-release operations.Support plans include options to have your name and title listed in the","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-22T03:55:38Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1835871199312020","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:03:50Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4778320-1834602721197977","game_id":"steam-4778320","kind":"announcement","title":"Crowdfunding Now Open","summary":"Crowdfunding for Aiya Desire is now open.Your support will help us complete the full game and further polish its visuals, audio, and presentation.Support options include development support, end-credit name/title listings, plans currently intended to include full-game access after the official release, and other limited supporter plans.Will you leave your record at the beginning of AIYA's world?Details and support: https://aiya-desire.vnlworks.com/en/crowdfunding","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-08T07:35:34Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1834602721197977","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:03:50Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4778320":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T04:22:54Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T04:22:54Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4778320":"2026-10-26T04:22:54Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4778320":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T04:22:54Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T04:22:54Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"4855680":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T04:22:54Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T04:22:54Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4778320","app_id":4778320,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:57Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"54530cbda5ac7bf218f5bf017c79acab4b69112a021f4c8ad2513136bf076ef2","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"Exploration × Rhythm Game × Horror Adventure?!\r\nAfter her mother dies and her father disappears, Aiya heads to Sentinel Radio Tower. Explore, solve puzzles, talk, flee a relentless pursuer, and survive 2-button rhythm boss fights. Did HC, the Harmony Chip, end the Infection Panic—or hide a secret?","publishers":[{"name":"VNL Works Inc."}],"developer